{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/51c732936d4cf9ee2ffcf16c21633623.poster.avif?t=1759242886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/51c732936d4cf9ee2ffcf16c21633623.webm?t=1759242886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Sons of Odin</strong> \u2014 a tactical card game inspired by an 18th-century Eastern European classic and Norse myth. Expect fast matches, hands-on learning through play, and a first look at heroes, clans, and their godlike abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/e2ea0db183ab6ccc879bf62ca1cba708.avif?t=1759242886\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Basic Demo</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP Modes</strong> \u2014 player vs. player matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Showcase</strong> \u2014 browse the deck, admire their visuals and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Concept Art Gallery</strong> \u2014 explore the game\u2019s atmosphere and world design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rules Section</strong> \u2014 description of the core mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/2568a64d31fb870944f8219e7b13fce2.poster.avif?t=1759242886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/2568a64d31fb870944f8219e7b13fce2.webm?t=1759242886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/7213d6f9fa698770d2ac6dd3ca90ca28.avif?t=1759242886\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated Demo (October 13, 2025)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PVP &amp; PVE Modes</strong> \u2014 2- and 4-player matches, play with friends or AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tutorial</strong> \u2014 a smooth introduction to the rules through in-game situations, no boring pop-ups</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Lobby</strong> \u2014 invite friends and set up private matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/52f70a89cd5288af9205d63b4b62c4cc.poster.avif?t=1759242886\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/52f70a89cd5288af9205d63b4b62c4cc.webm?t=1759242886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755230/extras/5e3503ef2d158bcf0093eff8d5af9e3b.avif?t=1759242886\" width=800 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense card duels</strong> with core mechanics rooted in a classic 18th-century card game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes with unique abilities</strong> \u2014 activate the Aspects of the Aesir by filling your Rage bar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable battle moments</strong> \u2014 Trickster Coins bend the rules, and runes influence the whole match</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl